# What must not reach the Docker daemon, and must never reach an image layer.
#
# The build context is this directory: `docker/docker-compose.yml` says `context: ..`, and the
# Dockerfiles copy `Cargo.toml`, `src`, `tests`, `examples`, `benches` and `config`, all of
# which are here. Without this file the context was 64 GB of `target/` plus 139 MB of
# `node_modules` -- and `docker/Dockerfile.build` did `COPY . .`, so building it baked `.env`
# into a layer. A key in a layer is not removed by deleting the file afterwards; it stays in
# `docker history` and in anything the image was pushed to.
#
# `Dockerfile.build` now copies explicit paths, so the credentials are excluded twice over.
# That is deliberate: this file protects a `COPY . .` someone adds later, and the explicit
# copies protect a context built without this file.

# ── credentials ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `.env` holds live provider keys on a developer machine. It is in `.gitignore`, which keeps
# it out of the repository and does nothing at all for a Docker build.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── build output and dependencies, rebuilt inside the image anyway ────────────
# `**/target/`, not `target/`: the first probe of this file still shipped
# `clients/dxmt-rust-sdk/target`, because a leading-component pattern only matches the root.
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
clients/dxmt-js-sdk/dist/
clients/*/build/

# `dashboard/dist/` is deliberately NOT here: `api-dashboard` embeds it at compile time, so a
# build with that feature needs it in the context. `dashboard/node_modules/` is covered above.

# ── runtime state, which is data and not source ───────────────────────────────
data/
wal/
snapshots/
# Both: `*.log` is the files, `logs/` is the directory the server writes into -- the first
# probe shipped `logs/` because a glob on the name does not match a directory.
*.log
logs/
pdf/

# ── not part of the product ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `planning/` is code kept out of `src/` precisely because nothing reaches it; shipping it in
# an image would undo that. Both CLAUDE.md files are gitignored working notes.
planning/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md

# ── noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.github/
**/.DS_Store
*.swp
